<title>UK: Nat. Power, PowerGen resume rally.</title>
<headline>Nat. Power, PowerGen resume rally.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in National Power and PowerGen resumed their advance on Wednesday, initially fuelled by a strong buy recommendation from brokerage UBS last week, dealers said.</p>
<p>By 0958 GMT, shares in National Power were up 10p to 427-1/2p, the highest level since mid-July. Shares in Powergen rose 5-1/2p to 539-1/2p.</p>
</text>
